From: tao3k team and Contributors
Subject: Native source identity and declaration-guided build ordering

Read source identity without expanding ordinary or explicit-header bodies.
Scheduling hints come from unexpanded native declarations; actual expanded
imports retain authority for dependency eligibility. Keep existing queues,
waits and machine capacity. Opaque reader effects remain cached exactly once.

